5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܝܼ ܕܙܵܪܥܝܼ ܒܕܸܡܥܝܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܒܫܲܒܲܚܬܵ‌ܐ ܒܸܬ ܚܵܨܕܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܕܚܕܵܪܵܐ ܚܵܕܹܪ ܘܒܵܟܹܐ ܟܲܕ ܛܥܝܼܢܵܐ ܟܝܼܣܬܵ‌ܐ ܕܒܲܪܙܲܪܥܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܬܵܝܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܐܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܒܫܲܒܲܚܬܵ‌ܐ ܟܲܕ ܛܥܝܼܢܵܐ ܕܲܪ̈ܙܘܼܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/126.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/127.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/125.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}